# Test: Tracked inserts render green + underlined, beating the squiggle
# Regression (Batch 5): typing with Track Changes on recorded the
# revisions but rendered plain black text with a red spell squiggle
# and only a 1px green underline beside it. The span must render
# GREEN glyphs + green underline, and the squiggle must not draw
# under a tracked span. "Hello" is a real word (no squiggle);
# "wrold" is misspelled (its squiggle must lose to the span).
# Capital "Hello": a lowercase sentence start would be
# auto-capitalized (AutoCorrect), changing the text and the
# revision count mid-test (see pass_spell_squiggles).
# Pixel-verified from the revisions_inline screenshot: green
# (0,128,0) glyph + underline pixels in the text row, no red
# (255,0,0) squiggle pixels there. The TRK field highlights bold
# while tracking is on.

menu_open Edit
wait_frames 12
menu_select "Track Changes"
wait_frames 12
validate track_changes_enabled=true
validate status_text=Track Changes: On

type "Hello wrold"
wait_frames 12
validate revision_count=11
validate text=Hello wrold

screenshot revisions_inline
